        "x1": 0.9424845070422535,
        "y1": 0.38626551724137925
      },
      "text": "His banket sometimes is greene beanes and peason. Nuts, peares, plumbes, apples, as they are in season.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.27165070422535215,
        "y0": 0.38679827586206894,
        "x1": 0.4999802816901408,
        "y1": 0.39740172413793107
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. ii. 38, f. 244.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7360084507042254,
        "y0": 0.388803448275862,
        "x1": 0.9497661971830985,
        "y1": 0.39844137931034485
      },
      "text": "Taijor's Workes, 1630, i. 97-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07003943661971831,
        "y0": 0.39766206896551726,
        "x1": 0.3874338028169014,
        "y1": 0.41156379310344826
      },
      "text": "PERTELICHE. Openly. (A.-N.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5194169014084508,
        "y0": 0.3988758620689655,
        "x1": 0.8194,
        "y1": 0.41183620689655176
      },
      "text": "PESIBLE. Peaceable. {A.-N.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5194169014084508,
        "y0": 0.4110068965517242,
        "x1": 0.828718309859155,
        "y1": 0.4396362068965517
      },
      "text": "PESIBLETE. A calm. {A.-N.) PESK. A peach. Nominale MS.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09028169014084506,
        "y0": 0.4117706896551724,
        "x1": 0.49309577464788734,
        "y1": 0.4227706896551724
      },
      "text": "Than syr Priamous the prynce in presens of lordes",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08987605633802817,
        "y0": 0.4242741379310345,
        "x1": 0.42993802816901405,
        "y1": 0.43440517241379306
      },
      "text": "Presez to his penowne, and per«i/ it hentes.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2315718309859155,
        "y0": 0.4349224137931035,
        "x1": 0.5003887323943662,
        "y1": 0.4462655172413793
      },
      "text": "Morte Arthure, MS. Lincoln, f. 84.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5198197183098592,
        "y0": 0.4388500000000001,
        "x1": 0.9497690140845071,
        "y1": 0.46562068965517245
      },
      "text": "PESON. An instrument in the form of a staff, with balls or crockets, used for weighing be-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07003943661971831,
        "y0": 0.44641034482758624,
        "x1": 0.4007943661971831,
        "y1": 0.46104999999999996
      },
      "text": "PERTELOTE. The name of a hen.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07003943661971831,
        "y0": 0.45899310344827593,
        "x1": 0.31820281690140845,
        "y1": 0.4746793103448276
      },
      "text": "PERTENERE. A partner.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5412788732394366,
        "y0": 0.4676879310344828,
        "x1": 0.7785267605633803,
        "y1": 0.4787982758620689
      },
      "text": "fore scales were employed.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10890422535211268,
        "y0": 0.47443448275862077,
        "x1": 0.4315605633802817,
        "y1": 0.4974689655172414
      },
      "text": "God graunt us mekenesse in angurs here. And grace to lede owre lyfe here soo.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5202253521126761,
        "y0": 0.4779103448275862,
        "x1": 0.7845943661971831,
        "y1": 0.4931603448275862
      },
      "text": "PESS. A hassock. Suffolk.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5202253521126761,
        "y0": 0.4912068965517241,
        "x1": 0.9489521126760563,
        "y1": 0.5068913793103449
      },
      "text": "PESSCOD-SCALDING. A kind of merry-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10971267605633803,
        "y0": 0.4979155172413793,
        "x1": 0.3356225352112676,
        "y1": 0.5096793103448276
      },
      "text": "That may aftur be pertenere",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5412788732394366,
        "y0": 0.5065293103448276,
        "x1": 0.7910647887323943,
        "y1": 0.5190206896551723
      },
      "text": "making in summer evenings",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5412788732394366,
        "y0": 0.5086620689655172,
        "x1": 0.9489577464788732,
        "y1": 0.532296551724138
      },
      "text": "; the treat, green field peas boiled in the shells. Yorksh.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11011830985915493,
        "y0": 0.5100603448275862,
        "x1": 0.39958591549295774,
        "y1": 0.5211706896551724
      },
      "text": "Of hevene, whan we hens schall goo.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.293512676056338,
        "y0": 0.5225379310344828,
        "x1": 0.5012,
        "y1": 0.5325586206896552
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. ii. 38, f. 14.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.520630985915493,
        "y0": 0.5314344827586208,
        "x1": 0.7627267605633802,
        "y1": 0.5466827586206897
      },
      "text": "PESSIPE. A kind of cup.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07003943661971831,
        "y0": 0.5338275862068966,
        "x1": 0.3364338028169014,
        "y1": 0.5495120689655173
      },
      "text": "PERTRYCHE. A partridge.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5198197183098592,
        "y0": 0.5455637931034483,
        "x1": 0.8870112676056339,
        "y1": 0.5595068965517241
      },
      "text": "PESTERED. Crowded. Peele, ii. 235.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09432957746478873,
        "y0": 0.5513793103448277,
        "x1": 0.5020084507042253,
        "y1": 0.5854724137931036
      },
      "text": "Ryght as the pertryche is constreyned undir the claues and nayles of the hauke, is as halfe deed for drede. Caxton's Divers Fruyt/iil Ghostly Maters.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5198197183098592,
        "y0": 0.5584913793103449,
        "x1": 0.9157521126760563,
        "y1": 0.5730275862068965
      },
      "text": "PESTERMENT. Embarrassment. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5202253521126761,
        "y0": 0.5719086206896551,
        "x1": 0.9493605633802817,
        "y1": 0.6263068965517242
      },
      "text": "PESTLE. (1) A leg of an animal, generally of a pig. A pestle of pork is still in common use. \" Pestels of venison,\" Warner's Antiq. Culin. p. 98. *• Pestell of flesshe,^'amJon,\" Palsgrave.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07125352112676057,
        "y0": 0.5877155172413793,
        "x1": 0.429143661971831,
        "y1": 0.6019482758620689
      },
      "text": "PERTURBE. To trouble. Palsgrave.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07125352112676057,
        "y0": 0.6020086206896551,
        "x1": 0.30768450704225353,
        "y1": 0.6153706896551724
      },
      "text": "PERTY. Pait. Lydgate.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12914647887323943,
        "y0": 0.6150948275862069,
        "x1": 0.36355211267605636,
        "y1": 0.6499810344827586
      },
      "text": "God that sittis in Trinitd, Gyffe thaym grace wel to the. That lystyns me a whyle",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5412788732394366,
        "y0": 0.6250155172413793,
        "x1": 0.9489633802816901,
        "y1": 0.6795275862068966
      },
      "text": "A pestle-pie is a large standing pie which contains a whole gammon, and sometimes a couple of fowls and a neat's tongue, a favorite dish at country fairs, and at Christmas feasts.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13036056338028168,
        "y0": 0.6507775862068965,
        "x1": 0.3376366197183099,
        "y1": 0.6622517241379311
      },
      "text": "AUe that lovys of melody,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13116901408450704,
        "y0": 0.6623965517241379,
        "x1": 0.4429014084507042,
        "y1": 0.6735810344827586
      },
      "text": "OflFhevon blisse God graunte tham perty,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1514112676056338,
        "y0": 0.6759827586206897,
        "x1": 0.39876619718309864,
        "y1": 0.6859086206896552
      },
      "text": "Theyrr soules shelde fro peryle.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5198197183098592,
        "y0": 0.6780431034482759,
        "x1": 0.8169774647887323,
        "y1": 0.7071086206896551
      },
      "text": "(2) A constable's staff. PESTLE-HEAD. A blockhead.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2829859154929577,
        "y0": 0.6866275862068966,
        "x1": 0.5016,
        "y1": 0.6972310344827586
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. v. 48, f. 47.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07125352112676057,
        "y0": 0.6972086206896552,
        "x1": 0.38865070422535214,
        "y1": 0.7254844827586207
      },
      "text": "PERUR. A kind of cup. PERUSE. To examine, or survey.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5198197183098592,
        "y0": 0.7068155172413793,
        "x1": 0.8748732394366197,
        "y1": 0.7326310344827587
      },
      "text": "PETE. Pity. See Cov. Myst. Long lay the kyng, there away wolde not hee",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09594929577464788,
        "y0": 0.7274672413793104,
        "x1": 0.5016,
        "y1": 0.7496672413793104
      },
      "text": "Monsieur Soubiez having perused the fleet, returned to the king, and told him there waa nothing",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.520630985915493,
        "y0": 0.7341344827586207,
        "x1": 0.948549295774648,
        "y1": 0.7446431034482759
      },
      "text": "Dayly he propherid batayle : the enmys durst not fyghte",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5198197183098592,
        "y0": 0.7459793103448276,
        "x1": 0.9485549295774649,
        "y1": 0.7686706896551725
      },
      "text": "Lacke of logynge and vitayle it was grett pete, Causid the gentill prynce to remeve, siche was Goddes",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0951380281690141,
        "y0": 0.7505086206896552,
        "x1": 0.5016,
        "y1": 0.7737379310344827
      },
      "text": "and that the mariners and souldiers would not yeeld to goe the voyage till they were paid their",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09554366197183098,
        "y0": 0.7525448275862069,
        "x1": 0.1372394366197183,
        "y1": 0.7615189655172414
      },
      "text": "ready",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14331549295774648,
        "y0": 0.7577258620689655,
        "x1": 0.14655211267605633,
        "y1": 0.7612103448275862
      },
      "text": ";",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5586873239436619,
        "y0": 0.7700362068965517,
        "x1": 0.604025352112676,
        "y1": 0.7797948275862069
      },
      "text": "myjte",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09554366197183098,
        "y0": 0.7734620689655173,
        "x1": 0.5012028169014084,
        "y1": 0.7850137931034483
      },
      "text": "arrears. MS. HarU 383.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5202253521126761,
        "y0": 0.7805948275862069,
        "x1": 0.9372197183098592,
        "y1": 0.8159655172413793
      },
      "text": "Lowe, how the good Lorde his owne gentill knyjte. Because he shulde remcmbir hym in wele and in woo. Thus in every thyng, Lorde, thy wille be doo",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07287323943661972,
        "y0": 0.787751724137931,
        "x1": 0.48175774647887326,
        "y1": 0.8150034482758621
      },
      "text": "PERVEY. To provide. (^.-A^.) PERVINKE. The herb periwinkle. {A.-S.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07287323943661972,
        "y0": 0.813753448275862,
        "x1": 0.4433098591549296,
        "y1": 0.8626258620689655
      },
      "text": "PERYE. A pear-tree. (A.-N.) But for hur lorde sche durste not done. That sate benethe and pleyed hym merye. Before the towre undur a perye.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7546309859154929,
        "y0": 0.8175741379310345,
        "x1": 0.9473352112676056,
        "y1": 0.8280310344827586
      },
      "text": "MS. Bibl. Reg. 17 D. xv.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5198197183098592,
        "y0": 0.8281741379310344,
        "x1": 0.8675802816901408,
        "y1": 0.8416275862068966
      },
      "text": "PETEOSE. Merciful ; compassionate.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5781183098591549,
        "y0": 0.8412741379310344,
        "x1": 0.8882422535211268,
        "y1": 0.8644448275862069
      },
      "text": "Many men spekes of lamentacioun, OfTmoders and of their gret desolatioun.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.27772394366197184,
